deft yaml - commands (input -> output)
  convert   yaml -> data       Change format: --to json|toml|xml|jsonl
  diff      yaml... -> report  Compare two files by structure
  format    yaml -> yaml       Tidy a file: --sort-keys
  merge     yaml... -> yaml    Deep-merge files; later files win
  validate  yaml -> report     Check syntax, or a JSON Schema with --schema
More: deft yaml <command> --help
